# One command opens the project: the agent, a shell, and what is changing.
title lmux create ~/src/acme-api
size 134 36
pre lmux kill --all
pre rm -rf .devcontainer
chapter The first workspace
caption lmux create ~/src/acme-api | the agent, a shell and the changes, in one command
run lmux create . --layout trio --nested
film 5 0.9
wait 5
frame 4
caption the status bar | the workspace, the windows, the agents, the sandbox, the branch
frame 4
